# Credits:
# The solver follows LIBSVM (Chih-Chung Chang and Chih-Jen Lin) and
# R.-E. Fan, P.-H. Chen and C.-J. Lin, "Working Set Selection Using Second
# Order Information for Training SVM", JMLR 6 (2005).
